WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.930
- Today we are doing an
incredibly unfair photo comparison

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:06.020
between the new iPhone 11 Pro Max

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.819
and the original iPhone.

00:00:09.819 --> 00:00:13.236
(light electronic music)

00:00:23.219 --> 00:00:24.810
Shops over here, we need to leave,

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:25.643
I'm gonna start shopping.

00:00:25.643 --> 00:00:26.970
I'm gonna sit like this.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:27.803
- [Jenna] No.

00:00:27.803 --> 00:00:28.636
- No?

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:30.393
Okay.

00:00:30.393 --> 00:00:32.290
Your finger is in front of the camera.

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:33.860
- [Jenna] I was like, that's weird.

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:35.010
I can't get the whole shot.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.010
- You gotta back up.

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.190
I love this so much.

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:44.023
- No sir.

00:00:44.023 --> 00:00:44.930
Why's it so small?

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:46.130
- It's so small.

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:48.000
So we looked it up just to confirm.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.680
This original iPhone is
a two megapixel camera

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:53.850
and the new iPhone 11 Pro is 12.

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:54.750
- It's 12.
- 12?

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.760
- I might wanna retake this.

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.270
- Yeah, I look like I fell asleep.

00:00:58.270 --> 00:00:59.570
Can you go back a little further?

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:00.490
- Yeah.

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:03.956
One, two, three.

00:01:03.956 --> 00:01:06.873
(light rock music)

00:01:24.043 --> 00:01:26.780
Not the best thing I've
ever done in my life.

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:29.060
- This looks like trash.

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:33.300
This used to be the norm.

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:35.650
Like this was incredible at its time.

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:37.740
And it really is kinda crazy
to see where we started from

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:38.850
and where we are currently.

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:41.480
I cannot wait to do a
comparison of a night shot

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:42.930
versus the original iPhone.

00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:45.973
It's gonna look like I took
it inside of a plastic bag.

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:47.672
Oh my gosh, how are you?

00:01:47.672 --> 00:01:49.260
Nice to meet you.
- I'm good, nice to meet you.

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:50.093
That's Jenna?

00:01:50.093 --> 00:01:50.926
- [Justine] Yes.

00:01:50.926 --> 00:01:51.759
- I'm Jenna too.

00:01:51.759 --> 00:01:52.850
- Jenna, this is Jenna!

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:56.160
Oh Jenn, you look really pixelated.

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:59.320
You look like a two megapixel potato.

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:00.153
Put your arm up.

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:10.580
This is seriously.

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:12.480
I cannot believe how
terrible this photo looks.

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:14.210
This could be anybody with brown hair.

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:16.860
- It looks like you took this in 1999.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:19.130
- This is where Apple got the inspiration

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:21.950
for the iPhone 11 Midnight Green color.

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:24.590
So I think that the only fair thing to do

00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:26.060
is to do a comparison between

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:27.323
the front facing camera.

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:30.740
There was a technique that I use to use

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:32.350
to take a photo of yourself.

00:02:32.350 --> 00:02:34.320
So I would go like this,
I would line my finger up

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.820
with the button, and
then I would hold it out,

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:39.100
and then I would know that the button

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:40.953
is just about right there.

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:51.570
Wow.

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:54.300
I look like I'm from 2007.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:55.773
Oh Jenna, this is a cute pic.

00:02:56.830 --> 00:03:00.060
I'm actually zooming in
with the 2x telephoto camera

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:02.893
to get the same distance
as the original phone.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:12.310
Okay, I'm gonna get closer to Jenna

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:14.823
so I can actually see
her face in this photo.

00:03:23.350 --> 00:03:24.210
You look young.

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:25.084
- Yeah.

00:03:25.084 --> 00:03:27.460
- Let's go to the beach!

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:28.610
This is gonna be great.

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:32.850
Okay, are we in it?

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:33.816
Oh you're good.

00:03:33.816 --> 00:03:34.649
- [Man] Go right ahead.

00:03:34.649 --> 00:03:36.130
- Actually, could you
take a picture for us?

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:36.963
Really quick.

00:03:36.963 --> 00:03:37.796
- Yeah.
- Okay.

00:03:37.796 --> 00:03:38.649
- Do you guys want more beach or house?

00:03:38.649 --> 00:03:40.453
- [Sisters] Whatever.

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:41.520
- [Man] Ready.

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:42.820
Three, two, one.

00:03:45.049 --> 00:03:46.030
There you go.

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:46.873
- Thank you.

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:48.633
Appreciate it.

00:03:48.633 --> 00:03:50.830
- There you go.
- Thank you.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:51.920
We are so pixelated.

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:53.455
- People are so kind,
they're not gonna be like

00:03:53.455 --> 00:03:55.320
your phone's really old.

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:56.900
- So let's take a few more pictures

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:58.490
and then wait for it to be nighttime

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:00.468
so we can get a night test.

00:04:00.468 --> 00:04:03.801
(electronic rock music)

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:25.271
This is gonna be a shot
with the original iPhone.

00:04:25.271 --> 00:04:26.883
Oh my god, I almost dropped it.

00:04:26.883 --> 00:04:28.600
(Justine gasping)

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:32.070
Compared to the iPhone 11.

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:33.424
So I'm gonna go get in that hole.

00:04:33.424 --> 00:04:34.770
- Oh.

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.490
- It looks so bad.

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:37.555
- Okay, go get in the hole.

00:04:37.555 --> 00:04:39.608
- [Justine] Okay. Do
I look stupid or what?

00:04:39.608 --> 00:04:40.441
- [Jenna] No.

00:04:40.441 --> 00:04:42.140
- [Justine] Could I look better?
Should I stand like this?

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:45.283
- One, two, potato.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:51.830
- Well that concludes the
test of the original iPhone

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:53.840
verse the iPhone 11 Pro Max.

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:56.750
This was so fun and it really
does take me down memory lane,

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:58.010
and right now I'm actually filming

00:04:58.010 --> 00:05:00.920
a Pixel verse iPhone 11.

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:03.070
So I may have already posted
it, or I may not have,

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:04.190
so look for that shortly,

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:07.300
or if I've already posted
it, here it is right here.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.060
A card or a link in the description.

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:09.893
I will see you guys soon.

00:05:09.893 --> 00:05:11.580
I hope you guys are enjoying
all of the iPhone content,

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:12.950
I've been having so much fun making it.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.750
A huge thank you to Tyler who's filming

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.220
and helping me edit some of these videos,

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:17.860
and Jenna over here.

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:21.160
She's been moral support
and phone photographer.

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:23.110
- This is bad, I don't
want credit for this one.

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:24.080
- It's pretty bad.

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:26.620
This is what we had.

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:27.700
Alright, that's it.

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:28.848
See you guys later.

00:05:28.848 --> 00:05:32.181
(electronic rock music)

